@9536. The ultimate receptacle of the heavenly marriage, which is that of Divine good with Divine truth. Signified.

@9601. The marriage of truth with good. Signified. For the conjunction of truth and good is called the heavenly marriage. @9736.

@9789[end]. The heavenly marriage is the marriage of good and truth, or the conjunction of the Lord and Heaven.

