@10001[2]. Therefore, by the place at the door of the Tent was represented the conjunction of good and truth, which conjunction is called the heavenly marriage. @10022.

@10300. The conjunction of good and truth is what is called the heavenly marriage, which is Heaven itself with man...

@10366. The heavenly marriage is the conjunction of good and truth with a man of the Church and an Angel of Heaven; and, in the supreme sense, the union of the Divine Itself in the Lord's Human.

