@10555. The conjunction of good and truth. Signified, Explained.

@10756. From the conjunction of truth and good descending into the body comes forth conjugial love.

@HH 281[2]. Hence the conjunction of truth and good is called the heavenly marriage; and the heavenly marriage is Heaven.

