@DLW 376. The Angels thus represented the conjunction of the heart and the lungs, and at the same time their correspondence with the love of the will and the wisdom of the understanding: they called this correspondence and union the heavenly marriage...

@402. In the created universe and in each thing of it there is the marriage of good and truth... @409, Explained.

